OL,3,ASinfield completes final ultramarathon
OL,4,Achallenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the crowd, Sinfield said:
OL,7,F"The rugby league community has got
OL,8,Fright behind the MND community and Rob
OL,9,Fwould be so proud to see how you've
OL,10,Fsupported and cared, and showed your
OL,11,Flove for a community that really needs
OL,12,Fus."
